    "section_text": "Bioinformatics Minor Students majoring in mathematics are eligible to pursue a minor in bioinformatics. See the description of the bioinformatics minor . Mathematics Minor Curriculum The minor will consist of at least 12 hours of MATH and/or STAT lecture courses at the 3000 or higher level, 9 hours of which must be completed in residence at Missouri S&T, and 3 hours of which must be at the 4000 or higher level. All courses counted towards the minor must be completed with a grade of “C” or better. Further, at most one of STAT 3111 , STAT 3113 , STAT 3115 , and STAT 3117 may be counted.",
    "section_html": "<div class=\"tab_content\" id=\"minortextcontainer\">\n<a name=\"minortext\"></a><h2>Bioinformatics Minor</h2>\n<p>Students majoring in mathematics are eligible to pursue a minor in bioinformatics. See the description of the <a href=\"/undergraduate/degreeprogramsandcourses/bioinformaticsminor\">bioinformatics minor</a>.</p>\n<h2>Mathematics Minor Curriculum</h2> <p>The minor will consist of at least 12 hours of MATH and/or STAT lecture courses at the 3000 or higher level, 9 hours of which must be completed in residence at Missouri S&amp;T, and 3 hours of which must be at the 4000 or higher level. All courses counted towards the minor must be completed with a grade of “C” or better. Further, <span class=\"sc_courseinline\"><span class=\"sc_courseinline\"><span class=\"sc_courseinline\"><span class=\"sc_courseinline\">at most one of <span class=\"sc_courseinline\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=STAT%203111\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'STAT 3111');\" title=\"STAT 3111\">STAT 3111</a></span>, <span class=\"sc_courseinline\"><span class=\"sc_courseinline\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=STAT%203113\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'STAT 3113');\" title=\"STAT 3113\">STAT 3113</a></span>, <span class=\"sc_courseinline\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=STAT%203115\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'STAT 3115');\" title=\"STAT 3115\">STAT 3115</a></span>, <span class=\"sc_courseinline\">and <span class=\"sc_courseinline\"><span class=\"sc_courseinline\"><a class=\"bubblelink code\" href=\"/search/?P=STAT%203117\" onclick=\"return showCourse(this, 'STAT 3117');\" title=\"STAT 3117\">STAT 3117</a></span> may be counted.</span> </span> </span> </span> </span> </span> </span> </p>\n</div>"
}